        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Excellent service and super knowledgeable staff. Thanks again, James!",
        "time": 1768439321,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Varun Tejpal",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101279079230993843719/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVzmFYZZGfNOGYGtIn0OLEByptq3NjYCeWkeeuZ94nU9axsd0Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 years ago",
        "text": "First time making wine. Staff is very friendly and seem to be knowledgable.  They had a fun wine event we went to and decided to give it a try. Will taste the results in a few weeks but so far so good!",
        "time": 1547324295,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Bob Marcy",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116915700630646711469/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXZz00q0CElgd5oJMZHIxyswItEupMtgRblLmVjPQeIx-1fUM_2BQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "Great little wine making supply store. Select from many varietals from around the world and if you pay an additional $50 they will help you start it on the premises. After that they watch your batch, rack the lees (dead yeast) off several times, filter it when done and call you in for the bottling.\nTakes much of the grunt work out of making your wine. And your basement doesn’t smell like a winery. Highly recommended.",
        "time": 1555766021,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jean-Jean Wei",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107687981694033158747/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUtogqtHe7AE-5FHflc8yupBjLRP2r42KxjxwBamES3iWbzkuMV=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 years ago",
        "text": "I have been visiting Vignes De Vaudreuil since 2013. The owner has extensive knowledge of the wine and can help customers to choose a perfect wine for them. The store is professional and clean. It has excellent equipments and staffs for wine making. They also make the bottling process a delightful and pleasant experience for customers.",
        "time": 1493393602,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Carmen Cortez",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112254199546974174560/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJEMkxzV7cQkcy9Fv0Qf8JYWYxJ9FQq9czyl0B2WYeiiJbIXw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "Bring your own bottles and fill them with fresh authentic Wine! you fill up the bottles yourself (before covid protocols of course)\nFantastic staff, incredible tasting wine\nAMAZING PRICE",
        "time": 1607198528,
